  lines:
  - text: Oof! You were hit! Make sure to heal every once in a while (Press 1)
    correctID: 2
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8b941eaeefd6c7445ab899bb478c0b17, type: 2}
  - text: There are also 2 more powerups you can use but we won't be needing them
      right now.
    correctID: 1
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a1eb5066007f0b34fbbbca8d77b047e1, type: 2}
  - text: 'Aeri, now would be a good time to use your "Whirlwind" thingy. '
    correctID: 1
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a1eb5066007f0b34fbbbca8d77b047e1, type: 2}
  - text: 'Honestly I''d love to but as Hy said, you can''t hurt him right now...
      which I find completely unfair.  '
    correctID: 3
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10443583e9eddbb4f862c7d83b067b15, type: 2}
